#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Appointments App</b>:</strong> Let families book meetings to "
"discuss camp options easily, reducing no-shows with automatic reminders.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການນັດໝາຍ</b>:</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຄອບຄົວສາມາດຈອງເວລານັດໝາຍເພື່ອປຶກສາທາງເລືອ"
"ກຄ້າຍໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ, ພ້ອມທັງຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການບໍ່ມາຕາມນັດດ້ວຍການແຈ້ງເຕືອນອັດຕະໂນມັດ.<br/>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>CRM App</b>: </strong>Capture inquiries from your website, "
"qualify leads in a visual pipeline, and convert interest into confirmed "
"bookings.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບ CRM</b>: </strong>ເກັບກຳການສອບຖາມຈາກເວັບໄຊຂອງທ່ານ, ຄັດເລືອກລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝ"
"າຍໃນຂະບວນການຂາຍທີ່ເບິ່ງເຫັນງ່າຍ, ແລະ ປ່ຽນຄວາມສົນໃຈໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນການຈອງທີ່ຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ.<br/>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Events App</b>: </strong>Create and manage every camp session "
"with custom forms, capacity tracking, and automated emails to keep parents "
"informed.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບກິດຈະກຳ</b>: </strong>ສ້າງ ແລະ ຈັດການແຕ່ລະຮອບຂອງຄ້າຍດ້ວຍແບບຟອມກຳນົດເອ"
"ງ, ຕິດຕາມຈຳນວນຮອງຮັບ, ແລະ ສົ່ງອີເມວອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອແຈ້ງຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ຜູ້ປົກຄອງຊາບ.<br/>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Projects App</b>: </strong>Organize the behind-the-scenes "
"logistics using task lists and deadlines to ensure every activity is "
"prepared to perfection.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບໂຄງການ</b>: </strong>ຈັດລະບຽບການກະກຽມເບື້ອງຫຼັງໂດຍໃຊ້ລາຍການວຽກ ແລະ ກຳ"
"ນົດເວລາ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າທຸກກິດຈະກຳໄດ້ຮັບການກະກຽມຢ່າງສົມບູນແບບ.<br/>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Sign App</b>: </strong>Collect parental consent securely with "
"reusable digital signature templates, ensuring all legal documents are "
"signed and stored centrally.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບລາຍເຊັນ</b>: </strong>ເກັບກຳໜັງສືຍິນຍອມຈາກຜູ້ປົກຄອງຢ່າງປອດໄພດ້ວຍແມ່ແບບລາຍເ"
"ຊັນດິຈິຕອນທີ່ໃຊ້ຊ້ຳໄດ້, ຮັບປະກັນວ່າເອກະສານທາງກົດໝາຍທັງໝົດໄດ້ຮັບການເຊັນ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບໄວ້ສູນກາງ.<br/>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website App</b>: </strong>Showcase your camps online with mobile-"
"friendly pages, integrated registration, and secure payment processing to "
"boost enrollments.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</b>: </strong>ສະແດງຄ້າຍຂອງທ່ານໃນຮູບແບບອອນລາຍດ້ວຍໜ້າເວັບທີ່ຮອງຮັບມື"
"ຖື, ລະບົບລົງທະບຽນໃນຕົວ, ແລະ ການຊຳລະເງິນທີ່ປອດໄພເພື່ອເພີ່ມຍອດການລົງທະບຽນ.<br/>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting 📈</strong>: Handle invoicing, revenue tracking, and full "
"financial reporting in one place."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ 📈</strong>: ຈັດການການອອກໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້, ຕິດຕາມລາຍຮັບ, ແລະ ລາຍງານການເງິນຄົບ"
"ວົງຈອນໃນບ່ອນດຽວ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Add custom tags</strong> like “IT Camp,” “Group Booking,” or "
"“Special Needs” to filter and segment leads."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ເພີ່ມປ້າຍກຳກັບກຳນົດເອງ</strong> ເຊັ່ນ “ຄ້າຍໄອທີ,” “ຈອງເປັນກຸ່ມ,” ຫຼື “ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພິເສ"
"ດ” ເພື່ອກັ່ນຕອງ ແລະ ແບ່ງກຸ່ມລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝາຍ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Appointments 📅</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ການນັດໝາຍ 📅</strong>"

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Assign opportunities to the right team members</strong> based on "
"region, language, or camp type."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ມອບໝາຍໂອກາດໃຫ້ສະມາຊິກທີມທີ່ເໝາະສົມ</strong> ໂດຍອີງຕາມພາກພື້ນ, ພາສາ, ຫຼື ປະເພດຄ້າ"
"ຍ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Automated email and SMS reminders</strong> reduce no-shows and keep "
"everyone informed."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜ່ານອີເມວ ແລະ SMS ອັດຕະໂນມັດ</strong> ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການບໍ່ມາຕາມນັດ ແລະ ແ"
"ຈ້ງຂໍ້ມູນໃຫ້ທຸກຄົນຊາບ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Built-in payment integration</strong> allows smooth and secure "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ລະບົບຊຳລະເງິນໃນຕົວ</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຮັດທຸລະກຳສະດວກ ແລະ ປອດໄພ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:summer_camps.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>CRM 🎯</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>CRM 🎯</strong>"

