#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:event.event,description:summer_camps.event_event_3
msgid ""
"📸 <strong>Photography &amp; Journaling</strong> – Document the week with "
"your own eyes and words."
msgstr ""
"📸 <strong>ການຖ່າຍຮູບ &amp; ການຂຽນບັນທຶກ</strong> – ບັນທຶກເລື່ອງລາວຕະຫຼອດອາທິດດ້ວຍສາຍຕາ "
"ແລະ ຄຳເວົ້າຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:event.event,description:summer_camps.event_event_1
#: model_terms:event.event,description:summer_camps.event_event_4
msgid ""
"🔥 <strong>Evening Campfires</strong> – Songs, stories, and marshmallow "
"roasting every evening."
msgstr ""
"🔥 <strong>ກອງໄຟຍາມແລງ</strong> – ສຽງເພງ, ການເລົ່າເລື່ອງ, ແລະ ການປີ້ງມາຊເມວໂລໃນທຸກໆແ"
"ລງ."

#. module: summer_camps
#: model_terms:event.event,description:summer_camps.event_event_3
msgid ""
"🔥 <strong>Evening Talent Share</strong> – Campers can share songs, poems, "
"skits, or creations by the campfire."
msgstr ""
"🔥 <strong>ການສະແດງຄວາມສາມາດຍາມແລງ</strong> – ຊາວຄ້າຍສາມາດຮ່ວມຮ້ອງເພງ, ອ່ານບົດກະ"
"ວີ, ຫຼິ້ນລະຄອນສັ້ນ, ຫຼື ສະແດງຜົນງານສ້າງສັນຂ້າງກອງໄຟ."

